<title>JAPAN: Nippon Filcon - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Filcon - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.26		vs	    7.41</p>
<p> Operating	  775    million	  vs	  838    million</p>
<p> Current	    605    million	  vs	  641    million</p>
<p> Net		  211    million	  vs	  246    million</p>
<p> EPS		    9.56 yen	  vs	   11.12 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     22 million	  vs	  22 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Filcon Co Ltd is a manufacturer of industrial nets mainly from special alloys.</p>
</text>
